    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In 2016, a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "documentary",
            "ref": "v-documentary"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " called "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "China’s van Goghs"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《中国梵高》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " made Dafen village popular. It’s a small village in Shenzhen. From van Gogh to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Rembrandt",
            "zh": "伦勃朗"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the village made almost 70 percent of the world’s art copies. No wonder people call it the “First Oil Painting Village in China”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But things are not easy for Dafen these years. Since 2018, its art sales have gone down. In 2020, sales even dropped by half. The village had to face a fact: It was time to change. So, the painters began to try new ways to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "make a living",
            "ref": "v-make-a-living"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Instead of copying, many started to create their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "original",
            "ref": "v-original"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " works. Zhao Xiaoyong was one of them. Eight years ago, he started making his own art. And this year, he held his first exhibition in Shenzhen. The show had around 40 of his original works."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Zhao is just one of many in the village. Dafen used to have over 1,800 workshops, but many of them have closed over the years. The rest no longer sell cheap copies. They now take "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "high-end orders"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " like painting portraits or making their own art."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dafen has also grown popular with young people and tourists. Many workshops have become coffee shops or art stores. For only 50 yuan, visitors can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "try their hand at",
            "ref": "v-try-one-s-hand-at"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " painting or even making their own pottery."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dafen village is opening a new and exciting story. What will it become next? Will it keep changing? Or will it be forgotten? Only time can tell."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
